e_ExSkill_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"あ、危ない！ご安心ください。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/QacdJjyrawNMGUDmjLscjaj2VyWjd95y.ogg"},{"description":"Hanae_ExSkill_3.ogg","category":"battle","text":"あぁ！キャッチ！これで安全です。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/LSaWSqAhe29KRjN8egNBaIpZvIAKb8RK.ogg"},{"description":"Hanae_ExSkill_Level_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"投薬を始めます。少し効きすぎたかも？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/hMADvOKkO7Rrcwgvj4nDtVK7pBj6Difv.ogg"},{"description":"Hanae_ExSkill_Level_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"治療を開始します。あっ、入れすぎちゃった。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/RbxNzGbRV9EwnsRwK924AdTtW5Twad4g.ogg"},{"description":"Hanae_ExSkill_Level_3.ogg","category":"battle","text":"これで痛みがなくなるはず！た、多分","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/RxO49b9oGanl959qoTZ2EC3yMD29gY64.ogg"},{"description":"Hanae_ExWeapon_Get.ogg","category":"growup","text":"この武器には……愛がたくさんつまっています！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/Dslnv5xP2cDvgmZGp5bD0u8VPN9Tmiym.ogg"},{"description":"Hanae_Formation_In_1.ogg","category":"formation","text":"治療なら私に任せてください！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/IAOkJQtCVV7D4tyJEIZYVOQG17MUxQzQ.ogg"},{"description":"Hanae_Formation_In_2.ogg","category":"formation","text":"私が手伝います。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/fokOCS0gGuYXepOvsUWH42flR9fQDNoq.ogg"},{"description":"Hanae_Gachaget.ogg","category":"growup","text":"白衣の天使が！ あなたを訪ねて来ましたよ！！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/bTUer3SVyVoAhoF21YX806HvQzZk4aSb.ogg"},{"description":"Hanae_Growup_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"いつも元気いっぱいの私ですけど、今はいつも以上に元気が満ちあふれてます！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/NysflYiS8idn4hR9IzBoYbxi7xDdCSbv.ogg"},{"description":"Hanae_Growup_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":" 具合の悪い方が一人もいなくなったら良いですね！私と先生で実現させていきましょう！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/M4jjottmAo2lJf7FExKoPiZWbxV6TroR.ogg"},{"description":"Hanae_Growup_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"もっと努力します！先生のために！そして、先輩達にとって自慢の後輩になるために！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/c9RPzyd9eweHmGdYKaVyEJWKsqznDGIU.ogg"},{"description":"Hanae_Growup_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"\t ミスをすることもありますが、落ち込んだりしません。先生が、助けて下さいますから！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/eodnhmkh3b7scbYEHDBsTFichFei6DHY.ogg"},{"description":"Hanae_Lobby_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"あっ先生！顔色が悪いです！ 簡単な手術をしましょうか？！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/w3UL9AmU8rUxvBZ6ZgeijjpGqUUuYjqI.ogg"},{"description":"Hanae_Lobby_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"活力や笑顔をご所望なら！ このハナエにお任せください！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/9DXV2n2I12SfZn9zyobCGoiZ2kP1zcJ1.ogg"},{"description":"Hanae_Lobby_3.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"先生が好きなタイプは？ ハツラツとした 可愛い女の子ですよね？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/xisES50j1dLeQBbsap2GbfMTQwjTiWrq.ogg"},{"description":"Hanae_Lobby_4.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"今日はやることがたくさんあるので怠けちゃだめですよ！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/zaTYJ11pjw8SSFTw471Kk2nX2YeFl51Y.ogg"},{"description":"Hanae_Lobby_5.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"あっ！なんだかいいことが起きそうな予感！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/YesjnFe7RwHl8bxWVqsvoUUxVJW0ZYdT.ogg"},{"description":"Hanae_LogIn_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"先生！新しいメールが届きました！楽しい任務を、今日も始めましょう！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/ccjgimnijrsMA0BbHzuKcHtIrrEtY7aN.ogg"},{"description":"Hanae_LogIn_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"きゃあ！ようこそ！先生が来るのを待ってましたよ！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/igByNm1ivHnmorHecL3XzLgPgJFCry7J.ogg"},{"description":"Hanae_MemorialLobby_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"さあ、ではまず傷口を消毒するので、 靴下を脱いで大人しくしていてください！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/ftaLh8skkTjDTaRtBcLRA7D45vNWoCG2.ogg"},{"description":"Hanae_MemorialLobby_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"きちんと消毒しないと、傷から炎症を起こして 大変なことになってしまうかもしれません。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/lR9XK5sjhVPyEjd3pyDQiVgVWwKtXrg3.ogg"},{"description":"Hanae_MemorialLobby_3_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"少し痛いかもですけど、我慢してくださいね！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/jfM6E5RWcpQZ7Akg9iYnyFnoIOy10MQB.ogg"},{"description":"Hanae_MemorialLobby_3_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"ん、しょっ…！ きれいきれいにっ…と！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/ICrgJQ18qKj5B6DARpYlLsP8eCfF7vWE.ogg"},{"description":"Hanae_MemorialLobby_4.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"はい、よく我慢できました！ もう少しですよー。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/WbQuNG8wuRjUwVtyoaumtS2u0J5emrmZ.ogg"},{"description":"Hanae_MemorialLobby_5_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"\t 特別におまけで、傷が早く治る魔法の呪文をかけてあげましょう！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/XgsYsxfZQaSDlvorZUpMr6G2yQzMMOJm.ogg"},{"description":"Hanae_MemorialLobby_5_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"では、痛いの痛いの、飛んでけ～！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/I2PUy7oOPkn2O1XZZYjB23WOLiMq7hnV.ogg"},{"description":"Hanae_MemorialLobby_5_3.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"どうですか？痛くなくなりましたか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/ddzuxughGhz6QHGJvebOfFKD9KVCKVHN.ogg"},{"description":"Hanae_Relationship_Up_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"先生のおかげで、私は幸せになれます！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/nrPPGEYq9zgT3oA1EfAt9EDEic53PziT.ogg"},{"description":"Hanae_Relationship_Up_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"私も先生に頂いた幸せを、他の人達に分けてあげられるよう頑張ります！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/uFQ1kaAQ9jbmCqGjewnrfuzjBAOzfh3Q.ogg"},{"description":"Hanae_Relationship_Up_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"痛みに打ち勝つのは治療ではなく、愛なんですね！先生が教えてくれたんです。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/cV7LsvtWdGViy66AXbUMfQAqMecoBNZz.ogg"},{"description":"Hanae_Relationship_Up_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"えへへ～、先生のほっぺた～、つん！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/lABgeY93CnVnv6QbqHBtuXVSMYy1MB37.ogg"},{"description":"Hanae_Season_Birthday.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"今日は私の誕生日です！誕生日プレゼントに、先生の一日が欲しいです。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/uMn17TUXlHCsAk2EjP5F8sDCyTBCJmzb.ogg"},{"description":"Hanae_Season_Birthday_Player.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"今日は最高に嬉しい日です！先生！お誕生日おめでとうございます！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/j