static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/WwNAb1jFTNBI5vWAVP9WaLXrJHV2vizj.ogg"},{"description":"hanae_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"开始治疗！啊，我放太多了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/NxelMHEdWZeg93PSOM4QcBzDRIjZczMx.ogg"},{"description":"hanae_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"这样大概就不疼了！大，大概吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/1HGdXbuygqsqQHmlIeQmwNM0Xbpcotee.ogg"},{"description":"hanae_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"这件武器之中……充满了爱！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/cR2MozuPBabfrzsNobFwqXeshWjr39yx.ogg"},{"description":"hanae_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"治疗就请交给我吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/5HVlJATFhhkfhGjA1m8jkQAvIWv8A0Le.ogg"},{"description":"hanae_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"我来帮忙！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/uuM0DJSM2kfRLCaJA5QBPv0tb0tAQvqN.ogg"},{"description":"hanae_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"白衣天使！降临到您的身边啦！！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/2U7uyvWBmm91FPVL4gTLmMr0RMwyKM3C.ogg"},{"description":"hanae_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"我总是充满活力，不过现在比平时更有活力了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/s8LL8YF44pk38MYn07snI90N7bMmwjPH.ogg"},{"description":"hanae_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"要是所有的人都能健健康康的就好了，老师和我一起实现这个愿望吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9C%9D%E9%A2%9C%20%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%9F/TvJTM7LjjXw5vfYNOwwFpXKehaIvf55o.ogg"},{"description":"hanae_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"我还会继续努力，不仅为了老师，也是为了让自己能成为前辈们的骄傲！","text_origin